      "title": "CJP announces Jantar Mantar protest on October 10 if CEC Gyanesh Kumar does not resign",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/cjp-announces-jantar-mantar-protest-on-october-10-if-cec-gyanesh-kumar-does-not-resign/article71538481.ece",
      "description": "He added that it is up to the government and the Delhi Police whether they “respect our right to peaceful protest or repeat the brutality we witnessed on July 20”.",
